# Cleanup Phase (BP-8 / PS-7)

**Purpose:** Dedicated phase for retiring migration artifacts after PS-5 (Migration) and PS-6 (Scale) are green. **No new features** — removal and consolidation only.

**Gate:** Cleanup may not start until BP-5 exit (entitlements + dispatcher) and SMK-PTL-02..08 green on final shell.

---

