## 4. What is NOT removed in Cleanup

| Item | Reason |
| ---- | ------ |
| `/me/registrations` route | URL freeze — permanent alias (DL-03) |
| Static `app/me/registrations/**` pages | Alias implementation |
| `resolvePortalRegistrationUrl` | Permanent registration builder |
| SMK-PTL-02/04 | Regression bar on alias |

---

## 5. Rollback

If Cleanup PR breaks SMK-PTL-02/04: **revert Cleanup PR only** — do not revert PS-5 entitlements or alias routes.

